Dear Maarten,

I am not clear wehether you can get any r-forge packages, but you will not 
get the latest ones of RSiena unless you have R 2-10.0 or 2.10.1 
installed. You need to get this from CRAN. It is probably a good idea, but 
not essential, to uninstaall the previous version first. There are 
instructions in the R for Mac FAQ on how to do it. Then you need to 
reinstall RSiena: I suggest you install it from CRAN first to get xtable 
automatically and then use the 'Other repository' option pointed at 
http://R-Forge.R-project.org to get the later one.

Regards,

Ruth


